<title>USA: Tenet FemRx in collaboration.</title>
<headline>Tenet FemRx in collaboration.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tenet Healthcare Corp and FemRx Inc said they entered agreement to provide more patients a minimally invasive alternative to hysterectomies.</p>
<p>Under the agreement FemRx will provide Tenet hospitals with &quot;preferential access&quot; to surgical instruments used in the procedure known as Out-Patient Endometrial Resection/Ablation, to treat abnormal unterine bleeding.</p>
<p>The two companies will jointly sponsor doctor training and patient outreach programs as part of the agreement.</p>
